{"id":"n53853-3-7","stage":1,"title":"건너다 · 跳过","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n53853-3-7-1","ko":"바빠서 밥을 못 먹었어.","zh":"太忙了，没顾上吃饭。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바빠서","meaning":"忙，忙碌，紧张","explanation":"바쁘다：忙，忙碌，紧张；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66248","senseId":"1","lemma":"바쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바빠서","audio":"/audio/f983361aa92644829534.mp3"}},{"text":"밥을","meaning":"饭，餐","explanation":"밥：饭，餐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"2","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밥을","audio":"/audio/59f360b400889823dcc4.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"먹었어.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹었어","audio":"/audio/6eb91d9162c5686b3840.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"23457023f6034aaf","term":"바쁘다","zh":"忙，忙碌，紧张","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3","entryId":"66248","definition":"因为要做的事情多或没有时间而无暇顾及其他。","pronunciation":["바쁘다"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭，餐","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"每天在一定时间吃的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ec99af330d745b3cde4e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n53853-3-7-2","ko":"아니, 끼니를 건너서야 되겠어?","zh":"哎，怎么能不吃饭呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"不，没","explanation":"아니：不，没。","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}},{"text":"끼니를","meaning":"餐","explanation":"끼니：餐；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"끼니","audio":"/audio/fd45e7bedaab129d98a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38436","senseId":"1","lemma":"끼니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끼니를","audio":"/audio/9f68b74428ed1b712fde.mp3"}},{"text":"건너서야","meaning":"跳过，隔，空","explanation":"건너다：跳过，隔，空；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作；야：强调或突出前面的对象，也可加强对比、条件等语气。","readings":[{"term":"건너다","audio":"/audio/07eea3489942d9d94543.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53853","senseId":"3","lemma":"건너다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건너서야","audio":"/audio/13f6321e077ed22c704e.mp3"}},{"text":"되겠어?","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되겠어","audio":"/audio/8a126b478c20ebd9cde6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不，没","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65980","definition":"用于表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"fd45e7bedaab129d","term":"끼니","zh":"餐","audio":"/audio/fd45e7bedaab129d98a6.mp3","entryId":"38436","definition":"每天一定时间内